transfer('freeze','Freeze the supplied base module while leaving the separate head trainable. Return the trainable scalar counts for (base,head) after the change.','base, head','for p in base.parameters():\n    p.requires_grad_(False)\nfor p in head.parameters():\n    p.requires_grad_(True)\nreturn sum(p.numel() for p in base.parameters() if p.requires_grad), sum(p.numel() for p in head.parameters() if p.requires_grad)',[('nn.Linear(3,2),nn.Linear(2,1)','(0,3)'),('nn.Linear(1,1),nn.Linear(1,2,bias=False)','(0,2)'),('nn.Identity(),nn.Identity()','(0,0)')])
